    "readmeMarkdown": "## Brave Search (official package, pending review)\n\nRuns Brave Software's official `@brave/brave-search-mcp-server` over stdio, pinned to `@2.1.0`; only the four listed search tools are requested and the server does not listen on a port. Search queries and result requests are sent to Brave Search, and the returned results are available to the agent. A Brave Search API account and `BRAVE_API_KEY` are required; usage and any charges follow Brave's current plan. Live-auth qualification and PuPu maintainer review are pending, so this entry remains `needs_review` and cannot be installed. Dependency review on 2026-09-12 reported security advisories in the resolved npm dependencies; remediation or an evidence-backed applicability review is required before enabling this entry."
  },
